# GitCraft preset: decompiled Minecraft with Mojang mappings.
# One argument per line. Paths follow the container layout (see docker/Dockerfile).
# Plain "mojmap" also covers the unobfuscated releases (26.x), so no second profile is needed.
--mappings=mojmap
--manifest-source=mojang
--artifact-store-path=/data/artifact-store
--override-repo-target=/data/repos/mojmap
# MappingLens indexes mappings and source code, not game data.
--no-assets
--no-datapack
--no-datagen-report
